{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_15\">Problem 15</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 15\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A line through the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/f/31f33a6e5478ea09f7137303a259e9f92b1c360b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-a,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> cuts from the second quadrant a triangular region with area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. The equation of the line is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/d/dedb1e93d750f4c5d66c4e4085f373d54f5cb2b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2Tx+a^2y+2aT=0 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2Tx-a^2y+2aT=0 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 2Tx+a^2y-2aT=0 \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2Tx-a^2y-2aT=0 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"675\" height=\"39\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The right triangle has area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, so the height <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/8/fe8b67d811cd77513aede8c77dbebe35cce28a04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}ha = T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"70\" height=\"37\" />.  This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/2/da2d18307f080c328877ba8459490ba9f45fcc85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h = \\frac{2T}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"59\" height=\"37\" />.  Becuase the triangle is in the second quadrant, the coordinates are the origin, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/9/a298102f416367047510cdfbe539b0927ed26bd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-a, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/a/60a51c4cb1c0180a191b90de77bca6b7fc37e1e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, h)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" />, which means the third coordinate is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/9/cd97396ce68b4adfcc85aade2451de313a37e8d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, \\frac{2T}{a})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"56\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>So, we want the equation of a line though <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/9/a298102f416367047510cdfbe539b0927ed26bd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-a, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/9/cd97396ce68b4adfcc85aade2451de313a37e8d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, \\frac{2T}{a})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"56\" height=\"37\" />.  The slope is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/6/8d674621e27173f7da68e22cd666309a1135cec0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{2T}{a} - 0}{0 - (-a)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"71\" height=\"45\" />, which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a55f6d1080e829827bc40cf0234322b56c13259.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2T}{a^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"24\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>The y-intercept is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/9/cd97396ce68b4adfcc85aade2451de313a37e8d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, \\frac{2T}{a})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"56\" height=\"37\" />, so the line in slope-intercept form is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/536a3bcee68d746371a8631e091ea01c6dc19835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = mx + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" />, or:\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/6/79699678ccad841c0679aa1e7505423152841263.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{2T}{a^2}x + \\frac{2T}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"117\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>All the solutions have a positive x-coefficient and no fractions, so we clear the fractions by multiplying by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/9698c992334be77221be8c8c819909eca34fde9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> and move the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> term to the right to get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/4/664eacddbdb9f99c1058cf3e7067c572ccb473e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = 2Tx + 2aT - a^2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"168\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>This is equivalent to option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=19